# Phase 04: Multi-Agent Adversarial Orchestrator

## Overview
Create a Python orchestrator that the brainstorm SKILL.md can call to run Analyst→Critic→Synthesizer pipeline. This is the highest-impact change: transforms single-LLM-single-pass into adversarial multi-agent.

## Design Decision
This is NOT a Claude agent spawner (that requires Agent tool in conversation). This is a **structured prompt pipeline** that produces 3 distinct outputs (analysis, critique, synthesis) which the brainstorm skill can feed to 3 separate Agent() calls.

The orchestrator PREPARES the prompts — the SKILL.md EXECUTES them via Agent() tool.

